Third-party sources

OpenAlex factual metadata are available under CC0:
https://openalex.org/transparency

Crossref factual bibliographic metadata are retained without publication abstracts:
https://www.crossref.org/documentation/retrieve-metadata/

The CWTS Leiden scope extract identifies CC0 in its source record:
https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23598555

The HERD linkage contains factual entries from NCSES:
https://ncsesdata.nsf.gov/herd/2015/html/HERD2015_DST_17.html

Source URLs and hashes identify the records supporting the retained facts.
Original source material remains subject to its provider's rights. The repository
includes neither full publication texts nor publisher HTML and does not relicense
third-party works. Bibliographic titles, identifiers and factual source fields
remain attributable to their original providers.
